          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "132"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.054,
            0.595,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.337,
            0.126,
            0.687,
            0.15
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 47 高尔基体的分离"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.158,
            0.268,
            0.18
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.192,
            0.77,
            0.211
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "学习利用大鼠肝脏细胞分离纯化高尔基体及其相对浓度测定的方法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.221,
            0.269,
            0.243
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.257,
            0.907,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "高尔基体是细胞中的主要细胞器之一，它存在于细胞质中，由于高尔基体的体积很小，一般需要用光学显微镜或电子显微镜才能辨认清楚，同时高尔基体在细胞中的数量很少，据研究，肝细胞中的高尔基体约占细胞质体积的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，因此给研究带来一定的困难。Leelavathi和Hino等用大鼠肝脏细胞通过匀浆、增加蛋白酶抑制剂、差速离心等，成功分离纯化细胞内的高纯度的高尔基体，并测定它们在细胞匀浆中的相对浓度，对高尔基体的研究起到重要的推动作用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.383,
            0.908,
            0.444
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "高尔基体的纯度可以通过检测高尔基体中的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta-1,4-"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 半乳糖转移酶（GalT）活性对于肝脏研磨液的增加程度来确定。本实验分离纯化的高尔基体，可以提供结构与功能方面的研究应用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.454,
            0.432,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.489,
            0.905,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:超速离心机、离心管、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "150\\mu \\mathrm{m}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 不锈钢实验筛和不锈钢接收器、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0\\sim 50\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Delta折射计、LS6500闪烁计数器、分光光度计、蛋白质检测仪。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.532,
            0.365,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:雌性大鼠。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.553,
            0.909,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）试剂:磷酸钾、氯化镁、高氯酸、二甲基亚砜，Tris、SDS、β-巯基乙醇、氯化锰、Triton X-100、磷钨酸、卵类黏蛋白、ATP、UDP-半乳糖、抑胃肽A、二甲胂酸盐、蛋白酶抑制剂片剂（完全不含EDTA的片剂）、活性为30～50Ci/mmol的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " UDP-半乳糖、乙醇、闪烁液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.637,
            0.793,
            0.656
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "所有的试剂均为分析级或更高，实验中使用的水是双蒸水并经过过滤。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.666,
            0.297,
            0.688
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.699,
            0.488,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）大鼠肝脏高尔基体的纯化"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.731,
            0.24,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.753,
            0.908,
            0.834
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 0.5mol/L 磷酸钾缓冲液，pH6.7:分别将 43.55g 无水  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "K_{2}HPO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和 34.02g 无水  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "KH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  溶于 500ml 水中，制成 0.5mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "K_{2}HPO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  及 0.5mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "KH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  溶液。在 400ml 0.5mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "K_{2}HPO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  中逐渐加入 0.5mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "KH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  溶液直到 pH 为 6.7。配好的缓冲液在 4℃ 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.838,
            0.907,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 2mol/L 蔗糖溶液: 将 342.3g 蔗糖溶解在预热到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的温水中。然后加水定容至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 中保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.88,
            0.857,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L} \\mathrm{MgCl}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": 将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40.7 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{MgCl}_{2} \\cdot 6 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 溶解到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水中, 室温保存。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.389,
            0.056,
            0.625,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第九章 细胞化学成分的分离"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.834,
            0.058,
            0.869,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "133"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.093,
            0.901,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）蛋白酶抑制剂:直接将一片不含 EDTA 的药片溶解在 50ml 溶液中，然后加入 50ml 抑胃肽 A（5mmol/L 贮液）。准备抑胃肽 A 的方法为溶解 3.43mg 粉末于 1ml DMSO 中，在 -20℃ 贮存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.157,
            0.903,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 梯度缓冲液: 如表 9-1 所示, 用前述的三种贮液和冷双蒸水配制 A~E 缓冲液。准备中等用量的缓冲液需要 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液 A、B 和 E, 并且需要 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液 C 和 D。缓冲液 C 和 D 中需要加入不含 EDTA 蛋白酶抑制剂药片 (每 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液需加入 1 片) 和抑胃肽 ("
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\mu \\mathrm{mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ")。通常需要配制 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 不含蛋白酶抑制剂 (价格很贵) 的缓冲液 C 用以清洗肝脏组织。配制溶液所要用到的水必须先放在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 中过夜贮存, 以确保所有缓冲液都是冰冻的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.312,
            0.897,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_caption",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.373,
                0.294,
                0.644,
                0.31
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "表 9-1 梯度缓冲液 (A~E) 配制"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.119,
                0.312,
                0.897,
                0.489
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_3_table_5.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>缓冲液</td><td>A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr><tr><td>蔗糖浓度/(mol/L)</td><td>0</td><td>0.25</td><td>0.5</td><td>0.86</td><td>1.3</td></tr><tr><td>0.5mol/L磷酸缓冲液,pH6.7/ml</td><td>10</td><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>2mol/L蔗糖溶液/ml</td><td>---</td><td>6.25</td><td>25</td><td>43</td><td>32.5</td></tr><tr><td>2mol/L氯化镁/ml</td><td>0.125</td><td>0.125</td><td>0.125</td><td>0.25</td><td>0.25</td></tr><tr><td>水/ml</td><td>39.9</td><td>33.6</td><td>54.8</td><td>36.8</td><td>7.4</td></tr><tr><td>总体积/ml</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>100</td><td>100</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>蔗糖%(w/w)</td><td>0</td><td>8.6</td><td>16.0</td><td>26.4</td><td>38.6</td></tr><tr><td>折射系数</td><td>1.333</td><td>1.346</td><td>1.357</td><td>1.375</td><td>1.397</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.499,
            0.903,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "当混合多种成分和使用折射计测定每种缓冲溶液折射系数时，操作过程应尽量精确。相对于蔗糖溶液，最终的折射系数应在±0.5%内（折射系数相差0.001之内），特别是缓冲液C和D。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.563,
            0.237,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 实验步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.585,
            0.901,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "本实验方案是对高尔基体膜进行一般的生化研究而设计的。它也同样适用于使用电子显微镜进行的研究实验。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.627,
            0.9,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 选 6 只雌性 Sprague-Dawley 大鼠，（每只体重 150～200g）处于饥饿状态 24h。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.648,
            0.903,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）把大鼠用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  处死，快速将其肝脏转移到大量冰冻且不含蛋白酶抑制剂的缓冲液 C 中（这一过程使肝脏降温并且洗干净血液）。然后将肝脏转移到含有蛋白酶抑制剂的缓冲液 C 中。用剪刀（图 9-1A）将肝脏剪成小块（每块直径为 4～5mm）。将剪碎的肝脏组织放到 50ml 规格的 Falcon 管中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.734,
            0.902,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）称量肝脏的重量，一般为 40～50g。最多能得到的 50g 肝脏组织可以做 12 个梯度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.776,
            0.904,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）用 250ml 锥形瓶轻轻按压不锈钢筛网，并转动从而对组织进行研磨（图 9-1B）。再加入少量的缓冲液 C（带有蛋白酶抑制剂）到筛中，使肝脏组织更容易进入并通过网格（图 9-1C）。将研磨液汇总到一支 50ml 的 Falcon 管中（图 9-1D）；最终研磨液溶剂大约为 50ml。保留 200μl 置于冰上进行酶测定。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.861,
            0.389,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 蔗糖梯度（图 9-2A）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.883,
            0.614,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）在 12 支 SW-41 超净管中均加入 6ml 缓冲液 D。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
